5	 * ({@code normalizedTelephone|email|householdId}) is already used by another owner. This single
6	 * check consolidates the former separate telephone, email and household duplicate checks. Handled
7	 * globally by {@link OwnerIdentityConflictExceptionHandler}, which responds 409.
